 "etapas": [
  {
   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Pain",
     "texto": [
      "To say «it hurts me», we use **mă doare**. The noun usually takes the article at the end: **Mă doare capul** («My head hurts»)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Singular and plural",
     "texto": [
      "The verb agrees with the part of the body: **doare** with one singular part (**Mă doare gâtul**) and **dor** with several (**Mă dor ochii**). Romanian does not say «I have pain», unlike English «I have a headache»."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    }
   ]
  },
